    <ul class="feature-runs">
      <li><h3>Least privilege, enforced</h3><p>Entra ID single sign-on with conditional access and MFA on privileged roles; roles reach down to record and field level.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Encrypted everywhere</h3><p>TLS 1.2+ in transit, AES-256 at rest, and keys in hardware-backed vaults.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Immutable logs</h3><p>Every create, edit, sync, and sign-off logged with the user, timestamp, and prior value, exportable to your SIEM.</p></li>
      <li><h3>Regional redundancy</h3><p>Active-active replication across paired Azure regions, with a recovery point objective of 15 minutes or less.</p></li>
    </ul>
